WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:06.680
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:06.681 --> 00:00:09.725
What do they see?

3
00:00:09.726 --> 00:00:14.305
They see a birthday party.

4
00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:20.524
The blobs look around.

5
00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:48.541
They see balloons.

6
00:00:48.542 --> 00:01:14.440
They see hats.

7
00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:34.922
They see noisemakers.

8
00:01:34.923 --> 00:01:54.300
They see presents.

9
00:01:54.301 --> 00:02:16.171
They see a cake.

10
00:02:16.172 --> 00:02:21.176
They see a piñata!

11
00:02:21.177 --> 00:02:38.022
The blobs run to the piñata.

12
00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:44.389
Blobs! What are you doing?

13
00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:53.036
Pop!

14
00:02:53.037 --> 00:02:55.672
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:57.748
Good-bye!

